sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Route as OpenShift Route
    participant OAuth as oauth-proxy Sidecar
    participant JL as JupyterLab Server<br/>8888/TCP
    participant CS as code-server<br/>8787/TCP via nginx
    participant CGI as access.cgi<br/>httpd CGI
    participant Controller as odh-notebook-controller
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,S3: User Request Flow (JupyterLab)
    User->>Route: GET /notebook/<project>/<name>/*
    Route->>OAuth: Forward request
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate OAuth token
    OAuth->>JL: Forward authenticated request<br/>NB_PREFIX=/notebook/<project>/<name>
    JL-->>OAuth: JupyterLab UI / API response
    OAuth-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: Workbench interface

    Note over User,S3: User Request Flow (code-server)
    User->>Route: GET /notebook/<project>/<name>/*
    Route->>OAuth: Forward request
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate OAuth token
    OAuth->>CS: Forward to nginx on 8787/TCP
    CS-->>OAuth: code-server UI response
    OAuth-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: VS Code interface

    Note over Controller,JL: Idle Culling Flow (JupyterLab)
    Controller->>JL: GET /api/kernels/<br/>Poll activity
    JL-->>Controller: Kernel status JSON<br/>(last_activity timestamp)
    Controller->>Controller: Evaluate idle timeout

    Note over Controller,CGI: Idle Culling Flow (code-server)
    Controller->>CGI: GET /api/kernels/<br/>Poll activity via nginx→httpd→CGI
    CGI->>CS: GET /healthz on 8787/TCP
    CS-->>CGI: Heartbeat timestamp
    CGI-->>Controller: Kernel-compatible JSON response

    Note over User,S3: Data Access from Notebook
    User->>JL: Execute notebook cell
    JL->>K8s: kubernetes client API call<br/>TLS, ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>JL: API response
    JL->>S3: boto3 S3 request<br/>HTTPS, AWS credentials
    S3-->>JL: Object data
    JL-->>User: Cell output

    Note over Controller,K8s: Build Pipeline Flow
    Note right of Controller: buildinputs generates<br/>dependency metadata
    Note right of Controller: check-payload validates<br/>FIPS compliance
    Note right of Controller: Konflux hermetic build<br/>with prefetched deps
